<p class="Biblio"><a name="ITU-T_X.509" id="ITU-T_X.509"></a>[4]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ITU-T&#xA0;X.509: Information Technology &#x2013; Open Systems Interconnection &#x2013; The Directory: Authentication Framework. X.509 version 3&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;International Telecommunication Union, International Telecommunication Union, committee, International Telecommunication Union (<a href="https://handle.itu.int/11.1002/1000/16853">https://handle.itu.int/11.1002/1000/16853</a>).</p>
