<p class="Biblio"><a name="des_mf" id="des_mf"></a>[6]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>DES Modes of Operation, FIPS Pub 81 (www.itl.nist.gov/fipspubs/fip81.htm)</p>
<p class="Biblio"><a name="rfc1423" id="rfc1423"></a>[7]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>IETF&#xA0;RFC&#xA0;1423: Privacy Enhancement for Internet Electronic Mail: Part III: Algorithms, Modes, and Identifiers, Balenson D. and Internet Engineering Task Force, RFC Publisher (<a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc1423">https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc1423</a>).</p>
